WEBVTT

00:01.059 --> 00:03.956
<i>[jaunty nautical music]</i>
<i>[欢快的航海音乐]</i>

00:04.025 --> 00:09.163
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:10.853 --> 00:14.025
Now remember, boyo,
I'm trusting you
现在记住，男孩，
我信任你

00:14.094 --> 00:16.577
to take care of me house
when I'm away.
照顾我的家
当我不在的时候。

00:16.646 --> 00:21.611
House sitting is a very
important responsibility.
坐屋是一件很
重要的责任。

00:21.680 --> 00:23.301
Check the windows,
检查窗户，

00:23.370 --> 00:25.335
and make sure
the security system
并确保
安全系统

00:25.404 --> 00:27.508
is always on your person.
总是在你身上。

00:27.577 --> 00:28.956
Ooh!
哦！

00:29.025 --> 00:30.370
[bat whooshing]
[蝙蝠呼啸]

00:30.439 --> 00:32.301
Yow!
- Whoa!
哟！
- 哇！

00:32.370 --> 00:33.991
- [goofy babbling]
- [gasps]
- [愚蠢的胡言乱语]
- [喘气]

00:34.059 --> 00:35.542
Scratch that last order.
取消最后一个订单。

00:35.611 --> 00:39.542
And do not step foot
into me bedroom!
并且不要踩脚
进我卧室！

00:39.611 --> 00:42.266
I've got me private things
in there.
我有我私人的东西
在那里。

00:42.335 --> 00:44.128
[giggles, clears throat]
[咯咯笑，清清喉咙]

00:44.197 --> 00:46.335
Now, Pearl is staying
with friends,
现在，珍珠留下来了
和朋友一起，

00:46.404 --> 00:48.335
so you'll be here all alone.
所以你会独自一人在这里。

00:48.404 --> 00:49.991
Don't worry, Mr. Krabs,
别担心，蟹老板，

00:50.059 --> 00:52.128
your house is in
good hands with me.
你的房子在
和我一起好手。

00:52.197 --> 00:54.301
Hmm.
唔。

00:54.370 --> 00:57.059
[sneezes]
Huh, huh?
[打喷嚏]
嗯，嗯？

00:57.128 --> 00:58.577
See?
[laughing]
看？
[笑]

00:58.646 --> 01:00.266
[sighs]
[叹气]

01:00.335 --> 01:02.025
Now, there's been
a rash of robberies
现在，已经有
一系列的抢劫

01:02.094 --> 01:03.197
in the neighborhood,
在附近，

01:03.266 --> 01:06.197
so do not open the door...
所以不要开门...

01:06.266 --> 01:09.956
[drawn out]
For anyone!
[拉出来]
对于任何人！

01:10.025 --> 01:13.025
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

01:13.094 --> 01:15.370
[sighs, laughs]
[叹气，笑]

01:15.439 --> 01:16.853
[knocking on door]
[敲门]

01:16.922 --> 01:18.266
[hums]
[哼哼]

01:18.335 --> 01:21.784
I told you not to open the door
我告诉过你不要开门

01:21.853 --> 01:24.404
for anyone!
对于任何人！

01:24.473 --> 01:27.680
Yes, sir![grunts]
是的，先生！[咕哝]

01:27.749 --> 01:29.577
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:29.646 --> 01:31.922
Uh, I think the boy's got it.
呃，我想这孩子已经明白了。

01:31.991 --> 01:32.991
[weak laugh]
[虚弱的笑声]

01:34.473 --> 01:36.197
Hmm...
[exclaims softly]
嗯...
[轻声喊道]

01:36.266 --> 01:38.784
Huh?
[goofy exclamations]
啊？
[愚蠢的感叹]

01:38.853 --> 01:40.301
Hmm.
唔。

01:40.370 --> 01:42.094
[toilet flushes]
[厕所冲水]

01:42.163 --> 01:43.853
[goofy exclamations]
[愚蠢的感叹]

01:43.922 --> 01:47.404
I checked everywhere
and no sign of robber... huh?
我到处检查了
没有强盗的迹象...嗯？

01:47.473 --> 01:49.577
Huh, Mr. Krabs' bedroom.
嗯，蟹老板的卧室。

01:49.646 --> 01:51.784
I don't remember
his door being ajar.
我不记得了
他的门半开着。

01:51.853 --> 01:54.335
There could be robbers in there.
里面可能有强盗。

01:54.404 --> 01:58.301
Do not step foot
into me bedroom!
请勿踩脚
进我卧室！

01:58.370 --> 02:00.128
Don't worry, Mr. Krabs,
别担心，蟹老板，

02:00.197 --> 02:02.680
I won't "step foot"
in your bedroom.
我不会“迈出一步”
在你的卧室里。

02:02.749 --> 02:05.818
[laughs]
[goofy exclamations]
[笑]
[愚蠢的感叹]

02:05.887 --> 02:07.473
<i>[curious music]</i>
<i>[好奇的音乐]</i>

02:07.542 --> 02:10.577
Seems pretty clear of robbers.
看来劫匪的踪迹还算清楚。

02:10.646 --> 02:13.232
[sniffs, giggles]
Smells like Mr. Krabs.
[嗅嗅，咯咯笑]
闻起来像蟹老板。

02:13.301 --> 02:16.059
Ooh, no wonder!
[laughs]
哦，难怪！
[笑]

02:16.128 --> 02:18.128
Hmm.
[humming]
唔。
[嗡嗡声]

02:18.197 --> 02:20.956
Better check in here too.
最好也在这里检查一下。

02:21.025 --> 02:23.059
<i>[dainty tune playing]</i>
<i>[优美的曲子演奏]</i>

02:23.128 --> 02:25.163
Aww, so Puffy.
哇哦，太蓬松了。

02:25.232 --> 02:28.542
Huh?
Ooh, "Midnight Pincer."
啊？
哦，“午夜钳子”。

02:28.611 --> 02:30.749
<i>[eagle screams]
[singer yodeling]</i>
<i>[鹰的尖叫声]
[歌手约德尔调]</i>

02:30.818 --> 02:33.922
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:33.991 --> 02:36.542
It's a very romantic-er-er
evening, Mrs. Puff.
这是一个非常浪漫的呃呃
晚上好，普夫太太。

02:36.611 --> 02:38.956
[imitating Mr. Krabs' laugh]
[模仿蟹老板的笑声]

02:39.025 --> 02:40.611
[exclaims]
Hmm.
[惊呼]
嗯。

02:40.680 --> 02:42.853
[laughs]
Nighty-night, Mrs. Puff.
[笑]
晚安，普夫太太。

02:42.922 --> 02:44.266
[goofy grunting]
[愚蠢的咕哝]

02:44.335 --> 02:47.715
Wow, look at Mr. Krabs'
knot collection.
哇，看看蟹老板的
结集合。

02:47.784 --> 02:50.577
Ooh, that dingle dangle
should "knot" be there.
哦，那个叮叮当当的晃来晃去
应该有“结”。

02:50.646 --> 02:52.266
[laughs]
♪ La-la-la ♪
[笑]
♪ 啦啦啦 ♪

02:52.335 --> 02:54.232
♪ La-la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

02:54.301 --> 02:57.094
♪ La-la-la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

02:57.163 --> 02:58.611
♪ La-la-la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

02:58.680 --> 03:00.922
[goofy babbling]
Huh?
[胡言乱语]
啊？

03:00.991 --> 03:02.956
[screams]
[尖叫声]

03:03.025 --> 03:05.887
[goofy babbling]
[胡言乱语]

03:05.956 --> 03:07.266
Ooh!
[grunts]
哦！
[咕哝]

03:07.335 --> 03:09.853
I'm still not
setting foot in here.
我还是没有
踏足这里。

03:09.922 --> 03:11.197
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

03:11.266 --> 03:13.163
Oh, that must be
the pizza I ordered!
哦，那一定是
我点的披萨！

03:13.232 --> 03:14.232
[doorbell ringing]
[门铃响]

03:14.301 --> 03:15.956
Whoop!
哎哟！

03:16.025 --> 03:17.439
Pizza delivery.
披萨外送。

03:17.508 --> 03:19.646
I'm not allowed
to open the door.
我不被允许
打开门。

03:19.715 --> 03:23.335
Just slide the pizza
through the mail slot.
只需滑动披萨即可
通过邮件槽。

03:23.404 --> 03:25.404
[pizza squishing, gurgling]
[披萨压扁，咕噜声]

03:25.473 --> 03:28.163
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:28.232 --> 03:30.818
And this is for you.
这是给你的。

03:30.887 --> 03:33.991
My third
mail slot delivery tonight.
我的第三个
今晚邮件槽投递。

03:34.059 --> 03:35.991
Must be a full moon.
一定是满月。

03:36.059 --> 03:38.991
[slurping]
[发出声音]

03:39.059 --> 03:41.094
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:41.163 --> 03:43.853
[sighs]
[叹气]

03:43.922 --> 03:46.818
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

03:46.887 --> 03:47.991
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:48.059 --> 03:49.508
[clears throat]
[清嗓子]

03:49.577 --> 03:52.404
I'm here for the Fast Food
Founding Fathers Convention.
我是来吃快餐的
开国元勋大会。

03:52.473 --> 03:56.335
Oh, you mean FFFF.
哦，你是说FFFF。

03:56.404 --> 03:58.197
That'll be 10¢ entrance fee.
那将是 10 美分的入场费。

03:58.266 --> 04:00.922
[shrieks]
[尖叫声]

04:00.991 --> 04:02.887
10¢?
10美分？

04:02.956 --> 04:05.404
That's a rip-off!
这就是敲诈勒索！

04:05.473 --> 04:08.025
I'm going home!
我要回家了！

04:08.094 --> 04:10.508
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

04:10.577 --> 04:13.542
What kind of crazy convention
charges 10¢
什么样的疯狂大会
收费10美分

04:13.611 --> 04:15.370
to a Founding... [stammers]
到一个建国之初...[结巴]

04:15.439 --> 04:18.956
Congratulations, you're our
100th person to enter!
恭喜你，你是我们的
第100位入场！

04:19.025 --> 04:21.508
Here's $1,000!
这是 1,000 美元！

04:21.577 --> 04:23.473
<i>[triumphant music]</i>
<i>[胜利的音乐]</i>

04:23.542 --> 04:28.025
What?
[holding note]
什么？
[持有笔记]

04:28.094 --> 04:29.370
<i>[static crackling]</i>
<i>[静电噼啪声]</i>

04:29.439 --> 04:31.197
<i>[mellow music]</i>
<i>[柔和的音乐]</i>

04:31.266 --> 04:32.887
<i>[lively music]</i>
<i>[活泼的音乐]</i>

04:32.956 --> 04:35.301
[all shouting]
[大家大喊]

04:35.370 --> 04:37.853
[chicken clucking]
- [munching]
[鸡咯咯叫]
- [咀嚼]

04:37.922 --> 04:40.473
<i>Shocking Cinema now returns</i>
<i>震撼影院现已回归</i>

04:40.542 --> 04:42.818
<i>with tonight's
frightening feature:</i>
<i>与今晚的
可怕的功能：</i>

04:42.887 --> 04:46.059
<i>"Knock, Knock, You're Dead."</i>
<i>“敲，敲，你死定了。”</i>

04:46.128 --> 04:47.818
<i>[cackling]</i>
<i>[咯咯笑]</i>

04:47.887 --> 04:49.749
[shrieks]
[尖叫声]

04:49.818 --> 04:51.887
I can't watch this!
[grunts]
我看不了这个！
[咕哝]

04:51.956 --> 04:53.094
[sighs]
[叹气]

04:53.163 --> 04:54.370
[knocking on door]
[敲门]

04:54.439 --> 04:57.301
[shrieks, babbling]
[尖叫声、胡言乱语]

04:57.370 --> 04:59.646
SpongeBob, open up!
海绵宝宝，打开吧！

04:59.715 --> 05:02.301
I forgot me keys!
[groans]
我忘记带钥匙了！
[呻吟]

05:02.370 --> 05:04.439
SpongeBob!
海绵宝宝！

05:04.508 --> 05:06.508
Huh?
SpongeBob?
啊？
海绵宝宝？

05:06.577 --> 05:08.715
[sniffs, smacks lips]
[吸气，咂嘴]

05:08.784 --> 05:10.715
What I always suspected:
我一直怀疑的是：

05:10.784 --> 05:12.956
SpongeBob is made out of cheese!
海绵宝宝是用奶酪做的！

05:13.025 --> 05:14.128
Hmm?
唔？

05:14.197 --> 05:16.646
Or was made out of cheese.
或者是用奶酪制成的。

05:16.715 --> 05:17.853
Oh...
- Who is it?
哦...
- 是谁？

05:17.922 --> 05:21.128
It's me, Mr. Krabs!
Open up, boy!
是我，蟹老板！
打开吧，孩子！

05:21.197 --> 05:22.577
You can't be Mr. Krabs.
你不可能是蟹老板。

05:22.646 --> 05:24.749
Mr. Krabs is at a convention,
and he said
蟹老板正在参加一个会议，
他说

05:24.818 --> 05:26.611
not to open the door for anyone.
不为任何人开门。

05:26.680 --> 05:28.266
What?
[stammering furiously]
什么？
[愤怒地结巴]

05:28.335 --> 05:29.887
Open up!
打开！

05:29.956 --> 05:32.715
Oh, you sound
like Mr. Krabs, robber,
哦，你听起来
就像螃蟹先生，强盗，

05:32.784 --> 05:34.611
but you look nothing like him!
但你看起来一点也不像他！

05:34.680 --> 05:36.887
Hmm?
Barnacles!
唔？
藤壶！

05:36.956 --> 05:40.439
Open up, you...
[stammering, grunting]
敞开心扉，你...
[结巴，咕哝]

05:40.508 --> 05:42.542
Huh. Aha!
呵呵。啊哈！

05:42.611 --> 05:45.508
[laughs, grunting]
[大笑，咕哝]

05:45.577 --> 05:47.853
<i>[devious music]</i>
<i>[狡猾的音乐]</i>

05:47.922 --> 05:49.542
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:49.611 --> 05:52.163
[growls]
Hmm?
[咆哮]
嗯？

05:52.232 --> 05:54.922
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

05:54.991 --> 05:57.680
Ugh, and I told him
to check the windows, didn't I?
呃，我告诉他
检查窗户，不是吗？

05:57.749 --> 06:01.818
[muttering unintelligibly]
[无法理解的咕哝]

06:01.887 --> 06:03.956
Patrick, you've gotta
come over to Mr. Krabs' place!
帕特里克，你必须
到蟹老板那里来吧！

06:04.025 --> 06:06.542
Someone's trying to break in! <i>- [moans]</i>
有人试图闯入！ <i>-[呻吟]</i>

06:06.611 --> 06:08.611
Uh, SquarePants. <i>- [moaning]</i>
呃，方裤。 <i>-[呻吟]</i>

06:08.680 --> 06:10.473
SpongeBob SquarePants. <i>- [moans]</i>
海绵宝宝。 <i>-[呻吟]</i>

06:10.542 --> 06:12.232
No, you're Patrick!
不，你是帕特里克！

06:12.301 --> 06:13.715
Please, hurry.
请快点。

06:13.784 --> 06:16.128
[grunting]
Huh?
[咕噜声]
啊？

06:16.197 --> 06:17.301
Patrick?
帕特里克？

06:17.370 --> 06:19.473
What's that pink clown
doing here?
那个粉红色的小丑是什么
在这里做什么？

06:19.542 --> 06:21.232
Eh, who cares?
呃，谁在乎呢？

06:21.301 --> 06:24.542
SpongeBob will never open
the door for him.
海绵宝宝永远不会打开
为他开门。

06:24.611 --> 06:26.611
[goofy babbling]
[胡言乱语]

06:26.680 --> 06:29.266
Beep, beep, beep, beep.
嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟，嘟嘟嘟。

06:29.335 --> 06:31.301
Great horn spoon!
很棒的牛角勺！

06:31.370 --> 06:33.025
How's he doing that?
他怎么样？

06:33.094 --> 06:35.749
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

06:35.818 --> 06:37.991
[both holler, grunt]
[两者都喊叫，咕噜声]

06:38.059 --> 06:40.059
[goofy exclamation, laughs]
[愚蠢的感叹，大笑]

06:40.128 --> 06:42.197
Thank goodness you don't
have any bones, buddy.
谢天谢地你没有
有骨头吗，伙计。

06:42.266 --> 06:45.163
Nope, all blubber.
不，全是胡言乱语。

06:45.232 --> 06:47.301
[laughing]
[笑]

06:47.370 --> 06:48.956
[clattering]
[咔哒声]

06:49.025 --> 06:50.725
[gasps] Someone is trying
to break into Mr. Krabs' house.
[喘气]有人在尝试
闯入蟹老板的房子。

06:50.749 --> 06:52.853
Then we'd better
get over there right away!
那我们最好
马上过去！

06:52.922 --> 06:54.197
We're already here.
我们已经到了。

06:54.266 --> 06:57.646
You mean you had me
walk in the rain for nothing?
你的意思是你拥有了我
雨中行走无缘无故？

06:57.715 --> 06:59.991
[grunting]
I've got it...
[咕噜声]
我已经拿到了...

07:00.059 --> 07:03.542
[grunting]
One little bit... there we go.
[咕噜声]
一点点……我们开始吧。

07:03.611 --> 07:06.508
Huh?
[babbling]
啊？
[胡说]

07:06.577 --> 07:09.439
[hollering]
[喊叫]

07:09.508 --> 07:10.991
[groans]
[呻吟]

07:11.059 --> 07:12.967
That robber doesn't
sound like he's gonna give up.
那个强盗不
听起来他要放弃了。

07:12.991 --> 07:15.680
Let's set some traps.
让我们设置一些陷阱。

07:15.749 --> 07:17.266
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

07:17.335 --> 07:18.611
Check it out, Patrick:
看看吧，帕特里克：

07:18.680 --> 07:21.301
if a robber happens
to open this door... bam!
如果发生强盗
打开这扇门...砰！

07:21.370 --> 07:24.335
This pillow will fall
on their head.
这个枕头会掉下来
在他们的头上。

07:24.404 --> 07:27.611
I call it "soft justice."
我称之为“软正义”。

07:27.680 --> 07:29.473
Good one.[laughs]
不错啊[笑]

07:29.542 --> 07:30.956
Look at mine!
看看我的！

07:31.025 --> 07:34.818
If a robber tries to come in
through the window,
如果强盗试图闯入
透过窗户，

07:34.887 --> 07:37.991
they'll put their hand
in this warm water
他们会把手伸过来
在这温热的水中

07:38.059 --> 07:39.619
and they'll have to run
to the bathroom!
他们必须跑
去卫生间！

07:39.680 --> 07:42.266
[laughing]
[笑]

07:42.335 --> 07:45.025
House all secure.
Now we relax.
房子一切安全。
现在我们放松一下。

07:45.094 --> 07:46.232
[glass shatters]
[玻璃碎裂]

07:46.301 --> 07:49.404
The robber!
To the battle stations!
强盗！
前往战斗站！

07:49.473 --> 07:51.715
[grunting]
There we go.
[咕噜声]
我们开始吧。

07:51.784 --> 07:54.473
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:54.542 --> 07:57.577
[wails]
Midnight Pincer?
[哀号]
午夜钳子？

07:57.646 --> 08:00.025
It smells so wonderful,
闻起来真是美妙极了

08:00.094 --> 08:02.508
but it burns!
但它会燃烧！

08:02.577 --> 08:05.197
[wails, grunts]
[哀号，咕噜声]

08:05.266 --> 08:08.128
[groans]
[呻吟]

08:08.197 --> 08:11.922
Take that![grunts]
拿着那个！[咕哝]

08:11.991 --> 08:14.646
Desperate times
call for desperate measures.
绝望的时刻
呼吁采取绝望的措施。

08:14.715 --> 08:17.508
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:17.577 --> 08:20.473
What the... not on my watch!
什么……不在我的监视之下！

08:20.542 --> 08:23.473
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:23.542 --> 08:26.680
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

08:26.749 --> 08:29.404
[babbling]
[胡说]

08:29.473 --> 08:31.232
[laughs]
The pet door.
[笑]
宠物门。

08:31.301 --> 08:33.887
Why didn't I think
of this before?
为什么我没想到
以前有过这个吗？

08:33.956 --> 08:36.611
Oh, boy.
[laughs]
哦，男孩。
[笑]

08:36.680 --> 08:39.577
Huh?
[shrieks]
啊？
[尖叫声]

08:39.646 --> 08:42.473
Hmm.
唔。

08:42.542 --> 08:45.335
Hmm, cheddar.
嗯，切达干酪。

08:45.404 --> 08:46.818
Sharp cheddar.
锋利的切达干酪。

08:46.887 --> 08:48.577
<i>[cow moos]</i>
<i>[牛哞哞]</i>

08:48.646 --> 08:51.508
[growling]
That's it!
[咆哮]
就是这样！

08:51.577 --> 08:54.128
Time to wreck this ball.
是时候毁掉这个球了。

08:54.197 --> 08:57.163
No Mr. Krabs-impersonating
robber will ever get
禁止冒充蟹老板
强盗将永远得到

08:57.232 --> 08:59.128
into this house
with us on the job.
进入这所房子
与我们一起工作。

08:59.197 --> 09:00.715
We're tough guys.
- Yeah.
我们是硬汉。
- 是的。

09:00.784 --> 09:04.266
[both giggling]
[两人都咯咯笑]

09:04.335 --> 09:07.818
Uh, I feel like
a tough guy action movie.
呃，我感觉
一部硬汉动作片。

09:07.887 --> 09:10.715
Oh, the tougher
the better, buddy!
哦，越艰难
越好，伙计！

09:10.784 --> 09:13.542
Oh, yeah! <i>- [grunts]</i>
哦，是啊！ <i>-[咕哝]</i>

09:13.611 --> 09:15.059
[banging]
[砰砰]

09:15.128 --> 09:18.508
Wow, Mr. Krabs sure has
an awesome TV noise machine!
哇，蟹老板确实有
很棒的电视噪音机！

09:18.577 --> 09:20.301
[banging]
[砰砰]

09:20.370 --> 09:22.301
[growling]
[咆哮]

09:22.370 --> 09:24.577
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:24.646 --> 09:25.956
[thunder crashing]
[雷霆轰鸣]

09:26.025 --> 09:29.025
[grunts]
I'm coming in hot!
[咕哝]
我火热来啦！

09:29.094 --> 09:31.818
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

09:31.887 --> 09:34.197
<i>[triumphant music]</i>
<i>[胜利的音乐]</i>

09:35.887 --> 09:38.301
both: Wow, 3-D!
两人：哇，3D！

09:38.370 --> 09:39.784
[groans]
[呻吟]

09:39.853 --> 09:42.818
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

09:42.887 --> 09:45.749
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

09:45.818 --> 09:48.266
[grunts, groans]
[咕哝声，呻吟声]

09:48.335 --> 09:51.301
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

09:51.370 --> 09:53.163
<i>[melancholy music]</i>
<i>[忧郁的音乐]</i>

09:53.232 --> 09:54.715
I give up.
我放弃。

09:54.784 --> 09:56.611
Here, look,
在这里，看，

09:56.680 --> 10:00.646
this proves
I'm the real Mr. Krabs.
这证明
我才是真正的蟹老板。

10:00.715 --> 10:03.715
both: Hmm...
hmm...
两人：嗯……
嗯...

10:03.784 --> 10:05.611
Oh...
[laughs]
哦...
[笑]

10:05.680 --> 10:07.646
Says you're an organ donor.
说你是器官捐献者。

10:07.715 --> 10:09.301
Nice.
- You play the organ?
好的。
- 你弹风琴吗？

10:09.370 --> 10:12.577
Give me that.
both: Sorry, Mr. Krabs.
给我那个。
两人：对不起，蟹老板。

10:12.646 --> 10:15.266
Oh, it's all right.
哦，没关系。

10:15.335 --> 10:18.577
I can't be mad at you
for following me orders.
我不能生你的气
听从我的命令。

10:18.646 --> 10:20.577
You did good, boyo.
你做得很好，男孩。

10:20.646 --> 10:23.922
You, too, Pat-o.
[both laugh]
你也是，帕特奥。
[两人都笑了]

10:23.991 --> 10:25.439
[knocking on door]
[敲门]

10:25.508 --> 10:26.508
all: Huh?
- The robber.
全体：啊？
- 强盗。

10:26.577 --> 10:28.853
Daddy, open up, it's Pearl!
爸爸，开门，是珍珠！

10:28.922 --> 10:31.128
I forgot my keys!
- [grunts]
我忘记带钥匙了！
- [咕哝]

10:31.197 --> 10:34.646
Well, you sound
like me daughter,
嗯，你听起来
像我女儿一样，

10:34.715 --> 10:36.646
Mr. Robber,
强盗先生，

10:36.715 --> 10:38.715
but you look nothing like her!
但你看起来一点都不像她！

10:38.784 --> 10:40.197
[laughs]
[both exclaim]
[笑]
[两人惊呼]

10:40.266 --> 10:42.991
Hmm?
唔？

10:43.059 --> 10:44.128
Hmm.
唔。

10:44.197 --> 10:46.473
Are those me private things?
那些是我的私事吗？

10:46.542 --> 10:49.301
Daddy!
[whines]
爸爸！
[哀鸣]

10:49.370 --> 10:51.059
Daddy!
爸爸！

爸爸！